<title>JAPAN: Shokusan Bank plans to list on TSE second section.</title>
<headline>Shokusan Bank plans to list on TSE second section.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shokusan Bank Ltd plans to list its shares on the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange on February 3, 1997, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>At the time of the listing, the Yamagata-based bank will issue five million new shares, the stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
